cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Ladrillo, please cite it as below."
title: "Ladrillo.jl: a calibrated reduced-complexity emulator of global mean sea-level rise"
type: software
## The version the GMD paper reports is the git tag v1.3.0 (Marcus 2026-10-15): v1.2's model and numbers, with the BRICK
## 2.0 comparison arm on the published MimiBRICK v2.0.0 joint posterior. main may carry a -DEV version ahead of it.
## v1.0.0 is the code as first submitted; v1.1.0 is the unconditioned predecessor; v1.2.0 used the May-22 BRICK 2.0
## posterior. Update this field and date-released at each tagged release.
version: 1.3.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/msarofim/Ladrillo.jl"
authors:
  - family-names: Sarofim
    given-names: Marcus C.
    affiliation: "NYU Marron Institute"
## The model-description paper (Geoscientific Model Development, in preparation) becomes `preferred-citation` once it
## has a DOI; the software DOI goes in `doi:` when the release is archived.
references:
  - type: software
    title: "MimiBRICK.jl"
    version: 2.0.0
    url: "https://github.com/raddleverse/MimiBRICK.jl"
